    {
      "id": 38,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Site visitors, from the `analytics` schema.** This is end-user traffic on tenant sites, collected by an anonymous beacon behind a consent gate \u2014 nothing is stored, and no session id is even created, before a visitor accepts.\n\n`country` is derived from a request header at ingest, and there is no edge in front of this platform that stamps one \u2014 no Cloudflare, no proxy. Treat it as caller-asserted and mostly `unknown`, not as geography."
      }
    },
